<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 18.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 18.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Monday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Telecasters Nqld     15.53    5.15</p>
<p> 2   Mt Leyshon Gold	10.25    2.44</p>
<p> 3   Aust Tour		 9.49    0.79</p>
<p> 4   Prime Credit Tr	 9.42    1.04</p>
<p> 5   Villa World	     9.24    1.19</p>
<p> 6   BT Prop Trust	   9.22    1.77</p>
<p> 7   Prop Income Inv	 9.16    1.10</p>
<p> 8   Indu Property	   9.15    0.94</p>
<p> 9   Gandel Retail Tr	8.68    0.90</p>
